# Beat 2, car: the coupe in clay with its lights' gizmos, its tail lights selected, then the rear left wheel with the spray emitter's dots.
stage car
clay on
wireframe 0.3
frame hero
select hero
orbit 30 0.7
view back
select hero.taillight_*
dolly 1.5 0.6
frame hero.wheel_rl
dolly 0.3 0.4
orbit 20 0.3
